  eventID: VasePostRepeated
  dialogueLines:
  - Literally nothing else can happen. This is becoming a waste of time.
  - There is absolutely nothing more to see here. Please move on.
  - I can assure you, nothing else is going to happen. This is pointless.
  - "You\u2019ve already done everything there is to do. Why are we still here?"
  - Nothing is going to change. The player is simply wasting their time now.
  - There is nothing more to discover. Surely you have better things to do.
  - Im running out of things to say. Nothing else is going to happen.
  - This has officially become a complete waste of time. Please move along.
  - Nothing more can happen here. The player is just going in circles now.
  - "There\u2019s nothing left to do. Even the narrator is getting tired of this."
